Flash - {{Mani|"Contractor Houryokuin Kanetsugu" & C4 or more|(Your Turn)}}
By sending your (Soul Core) to the Trash, pay one cost from the target to summon this card from the Hand.

{{Burst|s|After an opposing Spirit's (When Summoned/Reborn) effect resolves}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, put two cores from the Void to any Spirits you control. Also, if you have four counters or more, and you control any "Houryokuin Kanetsugu", during this turn, the opponent can't end the Attack Step via effects.

[LV1][LV2]
Once per turn, when your "Ninja Gale" family Spirits would leave the Field due to opposing effects, one of those targets can remain on the Field, exhausted.

{{Yo Unleash|1}} {{Burst|After an opposing Spirit/Nexus' (When Summoned/Deployed) effect resolves}}
(Once per Turn: Same Name) Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, draw two cards. Then, by sending one core from any of your "Izanami" Grandwalker Nexus to this Spirit, send up to two cores from the opposing Field to the Reserve.

{{Ka Unleash|1}} {{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
(Once per Turn: Same Name) Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, by sending one core from any of your "Izanagi" Grandwalker Nexus to this Spirit, heavy exhaust up to two opposing Spirits.

[LV1][LV2] (When Summoned/Attacks)
If you control any "Izanagi & Izanami", you can activate one of this Spirit's Yomi Unleash/Kamiumi Unleash.

{{Burst|S|After the opposing Hand increases via an opposing effect}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, for every three cards in the opposing Hand, return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] {{ua|Red/Purple/White}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/White Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] (Opposing Attack Step)
This Spirit can block while exhausted. Also, all your White Spirits with (Soul Core) on them gain +10000 BP.

Flash - {{Mani|"Contractor Barone" & C6 or more|(Either Attack Step)}}
By sending your (Soul Core) to the Trash, pay one cost from the target to summon this card from the Hand.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] {{Armor|Red/Purple/White/Yellow|Illusive Ultra Heavy}}
This Spirit can't be blocked, and is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/White/Yellow effects.

{{Unleash|2|Moon}} [LV1][LV2][LV3] (Either Attack Step)
When any Spirit/Ultimate exhausts, by sending two cores from any of your "Barone" Grandwalker Nexuses to any Spirit, during this turn, the opponent can't end the Turn/Attack Step via effects. Then, if it's not this Spirit which exhausts, you can refresh this Spirit.
